@startuml
title Interaction Service - Like/Clap Idempotency and Race Condition Flow

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12

actor User
participant "Client" as Client
participant "API Gateway\n:8888" as Gateway
participant "Interaction Service\n:8086" as InteractionService
participant "Interaction Application\nReactUseCase" as UseCase
participant "Interaction Aggregate\n(Domain)" as InteractionAggregate
database "interaction_db\ninteractions" as InteractionDb
database "interaction_db\ninteraction_counters" as CounterDb
queue "Message Broker\nKafka/RabbitMQ" as Broker
participant "Notification Service\n:8087" as NotificationService

User -> Client: click Like/Clap
Client -> Gateway: POST /interactions\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
Gateway -> Gateway: validate JWT
Gateway -> InteractionService: forward authenticated request

InteractionService -> UseCase: ReactCommand(userId, targetType,\ntargetId, reactionType)
UseCase -> InteractionAggregate: Interaction.create(...)
InteractionAggregate -> InteractionAggregate: validate target and reaction type

UseCase -> InteractionDb: INSERT interactions(user_id, target_type,\ntarget_id, reaction_type, is_deleted=false)

alt first request wins
  InteractionDb --> UseCase: insert success
  UseCase -> CounterDb: INSERT counter row if missing,\nthen atomic increment selected counter
  CounterDb --> UseCase: counter updated
  UseCase -> Broker: publish InteractionCreatedEvent
  UseCase --> InteractionService: success
  InteractionService --> Gateway: 200 OK
  Gateway --> Client: reacted=true
  Broker -> NotificationService: InteractionCreatedEvent(...)
else duplicated/double-click request
  InteractionDb --> UseCase: duplicate key on\n(user_id, target_type, target_id, reaction_type)
  UseCase --> InteractionService: idempotent success\nwithout counter increment
  InteractionService --> Gateway: 200 OK
  Gateway --> Client: reacted=true, duplicateIgnored=true
end

note right of InteractionDb
Race-condition guard:
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_user_reaction
ON interactions(user_id, target_type, target_id, reaction_type);
end note

note right of CounterDb
Counter update must be atomic:
UPDATE interaction_counters
SET like_count = like_count + 1
WHERE target_type = :targetType
  AND target_id = :targetId;

If the row may not exist, use INSERT ... ON CONFLICT
DO UPDATE SET like_count = interaction_counters.like_count + 1.
end note

note right of InteractionAggregate
DDD mapping:
- Aggregate Root: Interaction
- Aggregate Root: InteractionCounter
- Value Objects: InteractionId, UserId,
  Target, ReactionType, CounterValue
- Rule: counter must never be negative
end note
@enduml
